{"kind":"stack","id":"s-sound-distance","title":"Sound and distance","theme":{"background":"#f4f9ff","foreground":"#1a2a3a","font":"Arial, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-term","content":"Sound source"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-expl","content":"The place a sound comes from, such as a drum, a bell or a person's voice."},{"type":"button","id":"c1-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-term","content":"Fainter"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-expl","content":"Quieter. A fainter sound is softer and harder to hear."},{"type":"button","id":"c2-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"bell"},{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"As you walk further away from a ringing bell, what happens to the sound?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"It gets fainter","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"It gets louder","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"It stays the same","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"Which sound is most likely to be fainter when you hear it?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"A whisper from across the playground","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"A shout from the next table","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"A drum beaten right beside you","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"A pupil stands 2 metres from a radio, then 20 metres away. Which is true?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"The radio sounds fainter at 20 metres","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"The radio sounds louder at 20 metres","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-c","label":"The radio sounds fainter at 20 metres, because it is farther away","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"map"},{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"You are at the park and a friend calls to you from the swings. Do you run closer or stay by the slide and call back?"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-a","label":"Run closer to the swings","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Stay by the slide and call back","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"You run closer. Your friend's voice is now loud and clear. Sound is louder when you are nearer the source."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"You stay by the slide. Your voice travels across the park, but your friend hears it faintly. The farther the sound travels, the fainter it gets."},{"type":"button","id":"c8-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"Why does a sound get fainter as you move away from it?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"The sound spreads out over a larger space","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"The sound gets heavier as it travels","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"The sound stops working after a few metres","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-h","content":"Well done! You finished the sound and distance quiz."},{"type":"text","id":"c10-m","content":"You now know that sounds get fainter the farther they travel from the source. Keep listening carefully to the world around you."}],"actions":[]}}
